    "dynamic": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>动态池数据 · Demo</title><style>\n:root{--ink:#152b43;--muted:#6c7c8d;--line:#e1e8ef;--bg:#eef3f7}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:13px/1.5 'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif}header{background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:17px 28px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}header b{font-size:17px}header span{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:4px;padding:3px 8px}main{max-width:1440px;margin:auto;padding:22px 28px 32px}.toolbar{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:14px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:16px}.controls{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap}label{color:var(--muted);font-size:12px}select,button{font:inherit;color:inherit}select{padding:7px 10px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;background:#fff}button{cursor:pointer}button:focus-visible,select:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #6caeca;outline-offset:3px}.scope{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)}.cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:14px;margin-bottom:18px}.card{background:white;border:1px solid var(--line);border-top:3px solid var(--color);border-radius:8px;padding:16px}.card.selected{box-shadow:0 0 0 1px var(--color)}.card-name{font-size:14px;font-weight:600;display:flex;justify-content:space-between}.aggregate{font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:400}.balance{font:600 30px/1.25 'Avenir Next','Helvetica Neue',sans-serif;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;margin:10px 0 3px}.change{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);min-height:17px}.rates{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px;border-top:1px solid #edf1f5;margin-top:12px;padding-top:10px}.metric-label{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)}.rate{font:600 20px/1.5 'Helvetica Neue',sans-serif;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.panel{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:9px;padding:18px 20px;margin-top:16px}.panel-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:10px}.panel-title{font-size:14px;font-weight:600}.panel-unit{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)}.legend{display:flex;gap:18px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:8px}.legend-item{font-size:11px;border:0;background:none;padding:3px 0;color:var(--muted);display:flex;gap:6px;align-items:center}.dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:2px;background:var(--color)}.chart{width:100%;height:245px;display:block}.chart text{font-family:'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;font-size:10px;fill:var(--muted)}.chart path,.chart line{vector-effect:non-scaling-stroke}.detail{overflow:auto}.detail table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:12px}th,td{padding:10px 13px;border-bottom:1px solid #edf1f5;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}th{background:#f4f7fa;color:var(--muted);font-weight:500}th:first-child,td:first-child{text-align:left}.note{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:16px;line-height:1.8}details{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:16px}summary{cursor:pointer}details p{margin:6px 0}.footer{margin-top:18px;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)}.empty{color:var(--muted);font-size:12px}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px}.grid .panel{margin-top:0}.subtle{font-size:10px;color:var(--muted)}\n@media(max-width:900px){.cards{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\n@media(max-width:600px){header{padding:14px 16px}main{padding:16px 12px}.toolbar{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}.cards{gap:10px}.card{padding:12px}.balance{font-size:25px}.rates{gap:6px}.rate{font-size:18px}.panel{padding:14px 10px}.legend{gap:10px}.chart{height:240px}.card-name{font-size:12px}.aggregate{font-size:9px}.change{font-size:10px}.panel-title{font-size:12px}.scope{font-size:10px}}\n.time-hit{cursor:crosshair;outline:none}.time-hit:focus{stroke:#94a8ba;stroke-width:1}.chart-tooltip{position:fixed;z-index:100;max-width:calc(100vw - 20px);padding:10px 13px;border:1px solid #d6e0e9;border-radius:7px;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 5px 22px #152b4326;pointer-events:none;font-size:12px;color:var(--ink)}.chart-tooltip[hidden]{display:none}.tooltip-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;font-weight:600}.tooltip-date{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin:3px 0 6px}.tooltip-value{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;font-size:13px}.tooltip-value b{margin-left:12px}\n.chart-tooltip{width:365px;padding:11px 12px}.tooltip-table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:7px 0}.tooltip-table th,.tooltip-table td{padding:6px 7px;font-size:11px}.tooltip-table th{font-size:10px}.tooltip-table td:first-child{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}.tooltip-table tbody tr:last-child td{border-bottom:0}.tooltip-foot{font-size:10px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--muted)}.chart .axis-year{fill:#47657f;font-weight:600}.chart .axis-quarter{font-size:9px}\n</style><style>header,.toolbar{display:none}main{padding-top:14px}body{background:#eef3f7}</style><style>.rates{border-top:0;margin-top:0;padding-top:0}.card-name{margin-bottom:10px}.rate{font-size:27px}@media(max-width:600px){.rate{font-size:23px}}</style></head><body><header><b>动态池数据</b><span>独立预览</span></header><main><div class=\"toolbar\"><div class=\"controls\"><label>数据时点 <select id=\"period\" aria-label=\"数据时点\"></select></label><label>资产 <select id=\"asset\" aria-label=\"资产筛选\"><option value=\"all\">全部资产</option><option>白条</option><option>金条</option><option>白取</option><option>现金贷</option></select></label></div><span class=\"scope\">2023 年起 · 账单口径 · 核销后 · 余额单位沿用原表（未注明）</span></div><div class=\"cards\" id=\"cards\"></div><section class=\"panel\"><div class=\"panel-head\"><span class=\"panel-title\">资产余额</span><span class=\"panel-unit\">原表数值</span></div><div class=\"legend\" id=\"balance-legend\"></div><svg id=\"balance-chart\" class=\"chart\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"资产余额趋势\"></svg></section><div class=\"grid\" style=\"margin-top:16px\"><section class=\"panel\"><div class=\"panel-head\"><span class=\"panel-title\">核销后逾期率</span><span class=\"panel-unit\">%</span></div><div class=\"legend\" id=\"overdue-legend\"></div><svg id=\"overdue-chart\" class=\"chart\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"核销后逾期率趋势\"></svg></section><section class=\"panel\"><div class=\"panel-head\"><span class=\"panel-title\">核销后不良率</span><span class=\"panel-unit\">%</span></div><div class=\"legend\" id=\"bad-legend\"></div><svg id=\"bad-chart\" class=\"chart\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"核销后不良率趋势\"></svg></section></div><div class=\"note\">现金贷＝金条＋白取，属于合计口径，不与金条、白取重复相加。趋势按真实日期间距排列；空白数据保留缺失，折线不跨缺失点连接。</div><details><summary>原表统计口径</summary><div id=\"notes\"></div></details><div class=\"footer\" id=\"source\"></div></main>\n<div id=\"chart-tooltip\" class=\"chart-tooltip\" role=\"tooltip\" aria-live=\"polite\" hidden></div>\n<script id=\"pool-data\" type=\"application/json\">{\"periods\": [{\"col\": 9, \"date\": \"2023-06-01\"}, {\"col\": 10, \"date\": \"2023-09-01\"}, {\"col\": 11, \"date\": \"2023-12-01\"}, {\"col\": 12, \"date\": \"2024-06-01\"}, {\"col\": 13, \"date\": \"2024-09-01\"}, {\"col\": 14, \"date\": \"2024-12-01\"}, {\"col\": 15, \"date\": \"2025-06-01\"}, {\"col\": 16, \"date\": \"2025-12-01\"}, {\"col\": 17, \"date\": \"2026-06-01\"}], \"assets\": [{\"name\": \"白条\", \"metrics\": {\"balance\": [{\"value\": 996.59, \"display\": \"996.59\", \"cell\": \"J4\"}, {\"value\": 919.19, \"display\": \"919.19\", \"cell\": \"K4\"}, {\"value\": 943.65, \"display\": \"943.65\", \"cell\": \"L4\"}, {\"value\": 1021.17, \"display\": \"1021.17\", \"cell\": \"M4\"}, {\"value\": 978.48, \"display\": \"978.48\", \"cell\": \"N4\"}, {\"value\": 1027.74, \"display\": \"1027.74\", \"cell\": \"O4\"}, {\"value\": 1161.8, \"display\": \"1161.80\", \"cell\": \"P4\"}, {\"value\": 1135.02, \"display\": \"1135.